    rdfs:label "Turkish MS 4" ;
    dct:date "17th century" ;
    dct:description "Seventeenth century scroll depicting an Ottoman Imperial procession. The Sultan is accompanied by his officers of state, military commanders, his household guard and other officials. Each of the officials is identified with a Turkish titles below, which has been transliterated into the Latin alphabet above. French captions have been added along the bottom of the scroll." ;
    dct:identifier "manuscript_14564" ;
