    rdfs:label "Persian MS 989" ;
    dct:description """An undated copy of a geographical work entitle Haft Iqlīm (Seven Climes) authored by Amīn Aḥmad al-Rāzī, fl. 1593-1619 , 
                     an Iranian émigré to India who composed this work for his patron, the Mughal ruler, Emperor Jahāngīr (r. 1605–1626) .""" ;
