fihrist:manuscript_6659 a mdhn:Manuscript ;
    rdfs:label "Persian MS 178" ;
    dct:date "1808-12-22" ;
    dct:description """Seventh volume an incomplete set of the Rawz̤at al-Ṣafā (Garden of Purity), a general history from the creation of the world to the
                     time of the author, together with Persian MS
                           173 , 174 , 175 , 176 , and 178 .
                     However, the set lacks the fourth volume and a geographical appendix often
                     added as the eighth, hence only six total. While most of the set appears nearly
                     uniformly bound, this volume completely differs from the others both in terms
                     of its text format and binding.""" ;
