fihrist:manuscript_6777 a mdhn:Manuscript ;
    rdfs:label "Persian MS 288" ;
    dct:description """This copy of the Dīvān of Ḥāfiẓ
                     (ca. 1315–1390) contains variant ghazal lyric poems and quatrains and
                     compositions typically found in other copies. Complete, albeit unsigned an
                     undated, the volume probably dates to the Ottoman empire suffered extensive damage with many folios subsequently replaced. The""" ;
