fihrist:manuscript_6928 a mdhn:Manuscript ;
    rdfs:label "Persian MS 431" ;
    dct:date "1863-07-12" ;
    dct:description """The Iqbālnāmah-'i Tārīkh-i Humayūn Pādishāh (The Book of Prosperity of the History of the Emperor Humāyūn), a general history of the reign of the Mughal ruler Humāyūn (b. 1508, r. 1530–40, 1555–56) , probably spuriously ascribed to famed 16th-century Mughal poet Fayz̤ī. 
                     Completed on 12 July 1863 , this work appears abridged from earlier sources.""" ;
