fihrist:manuscript_7312 a mdhn:Manuscript ;
    rdfs:label "Persian MS 806" ;
    dct:date "1673-02-17" ;
    dct:description """The fifth volume of the Rawz̤at al-Ṣafāʼ (Garden of Purity), a general history from the creation of the world to the time of the author, Muḥammad ibn Khāvandshāh (1433–1498) , 
                     known as Mīr Khvānd .  
                     Combined with other disparate volumes and uniformly bound with Persian MS 801 , 802 , 803 , 804 , 805 , 
